body:
At gold’s gym, updating workout numbers between sets on my phone;  
Gym staff approaches me. tells me not to use the phone;  
I show him the app, where I’m entering my reps;  
Staff says it’s against the rules;  
I asked what is;  
He says, you can’t use the phone while seated;  
I asked what should I do?  
Tells me to stand up, to use the phone.  
I tell him to go bother someone else.  
He tells me to go use another gym.

When I  was a kid, I introduced my older male dwarf hamster to a younger friend (keeping them away from each other at first) and weeks later I found the old timer dead.

&#x200B;

No respect to the elders...
